= Intro

== Domain of EPART

Pattern recognition system:
- input
- sensing
- segmentation
- feature extraction
- classification (missing features, use of context information)
- post-processing (risk-estimation)
- decision

EPART interests in classification, post-processing and decision

== Design cycle

+ start
+ collect data
+ choose features (using domain knowledge)
+ choose model
+ train classifier (problem of overfitting)
+ evaluate classifier